<cl=00FF00>THE HOSTAGE<br>
<br>
<cl=FFFFFF>This NPC in most cases needs to be rescued from the clutches of criminals. This can be done by taking him out of the dungeon or by dragging him along the surface to a certain point.<br>
The hostage must not die in any case, otherwise the mission will fail.<br>
<br>
<l="hts:\\language\helpindex.hts">Full help for the game (F1)<\l><br>
}